T*
T*
(1. Controller. Northwind Analytics GmbH, Hafenstrasse 12, 28217 Bremen,) Tj
T*
(Germany, is the controller for personal data processed through our) Tj
T*
(analytics platform.) Tj
T*
T*
(2. Data we collect. We collect account data \(name, work email\), usage) Tj
T*
(data \(log files, feature interactions\) and customer-provided datasets) Tj
T*
(uploaded to the platform. We do not collect special categories of) Tj
T*
(personal data unless you provide them explicitly.) Tj
T*
T*
(3. Purposes and legal bases. We process account data to perform our) Tj
T*
(contract with you \(Art. 6\(1\)\(b\) GDPR\) and usage data based on our) Tj
T*
(legitimate interest in improving the platform \(Art. 6\(1\)\(f\) GDPR\).) Tj
T*
(Marketing emails are sent only with your consent \(Art. 6\(1\)\(a\) GDPR\).) Tj
T*
T*
(4. Retention. The retention period for customer data is 24 months.) Tj
T*
(After this period, personal data is deleted or anonymised. Log files) Tj
T*
(are retained for 12 months for security purposes.) Tj
T*
T*
(5. Your rights. You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict) Tj
T*
(or port your data, and to object to processing. Contact our data) Tj
T*
(protection officer at dpo@northwind-example.de.) Tj
T*
T*
(6. Data sharing. We share data only with processors bound by Art. 28) Tj
T*
(GDPR agreements. No sale of personal data takes place.) Tj
T*
T*
(7. Security measures. We protect personal data with encryption in) Tj
T*
(transit and at rest, role-based access controls, multi-factor) Tj
T*
(authentication and regular penetration testing of our platform.) Tj
T*
T*
(8. International transfers. Where data leaves the EEA, we rely on) Tj
T*
(adequacy decisions or standard contractual clauses under Art. 46 GDPR) Tj
T*
(to guarantee an equivalent level of protection.) Tj
T*
T*
(9. Supervisory authority. You may lodge a complaint with your local) Tj
T*
(data protection authority, e.g. Die Landesbeauftragte fuer Datenschutz) Tj
T*
(und Informationsfreiheit in Bremen.) Tj
T*
T*
T*
(10. Cookies. We use strictly necessary cookies to keep you signed) Tj
